1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,869
Outlook sempat mati sekitar sehari.

2
00:00:02,869 --> 00:00:04,998
Dan itu bukan karena diretas.

3
00:00:05,548 --> 00:00:06,954
Tanggal 12 November,

4
00:00:06,954 --> 00:00:09,346
server email Microsoft mulai gagal

5
00:00:09,346 --> 00:00:11,807
di pemeriksaan otomatisnya sendiri,

6
00:00:11,807 --> 00:00:12,722
lalu offline.

7
00:00:12,722 --> 00:00:16,028
Server yang tersisa kewalahan dan ikut tumbang.

8
00:00:16,028 --> 00:00:18,982
Outlook dan Teams lumpuh di seluruh dunia.

9
00:00:18,982 --> 00:00:22,076
Penyebab pastinya belum diumumkan Microsoft.

10
00:00:22,626 --> 00:00:24,036
Kalau terjadi lagi,

11
00:00:24,036 --> 00:00:26,559
cek dulu halaman status Microsoft.

12
00:00:26,559 --> 00:00:28,636
Siap-siap email telat masuk.

13
00:00:28,636 --> 00:00:29,675
Yang mendesak,

14
00:00:29,675 --> 00:00:32,272
pindahkan ke telepon atau WhatsApp.

15
00:00:32,822 --> 00:00:34,541
Perlu pindah ke Google?

16
00:00:34,541 --> 00:00:34,915
Bisa,

17
00:00:34,915 --> 00:00:37,083
tapi Google juga pernah down,

18
00:00:37,083 --> 00:00:39,625
dan migrasi satu kantor itu mahal.

19
00:00:39,625 --> 00:00:42,166
Rencana cadangan jauh lebih murah.

20
00:00:42,716 --> 00:00:45,459
Kita nggak bisa mencegah Microsoft gangguan,

21
00:00:45,459 --> 00:00:47,766
tapi bisa menjaga bisnis tetap jalan.

22
00:00:47,766 --> 00:00:49,760
Tentukan jalur komunikasi kedua,

23
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,067
simpan kontak penting secara offline,

24
00:00:52,067 --> 00:00:53,812
dan latih rencananya sekali.

25
00:00:54,362 --> 00:00:57,166
Kantor kamu ngapain waktu Outlook mati?

26
00:00:57,166 --> 00:00:58,460
Tulis di komentar.
